import mundane definition stdlib/divisibility/even
import mundane theorem    stdlib/divisibility/not-both

theorem no-integers-with-eighteen-a-plus-six-b-one
  note        If 18a + 6b = 1 then 1 = 2(9a + 3b) is even, and it is odd.
  then not (there exist a, b ∈ ℤ such that 18a + 6b = 1)

1.  not (there exist a, b ∈ ℤ such that 18a + 6b = 1)
    contradiction
    suppose there exist a, b ∈ ℤ such that 18a + 6b = 1               (S)

    1.1.  a ∈ ℤ. b ∈ ℤ. 18a + 6b = 1.
          obtain a, b from S

    1.2.  1 = 2(9a + 3b)
          algebra, from 1.1

    1.3.  1 is even
          mun:even n := 1, from 1.2

    1.4.  1 is not odd
          mun:not-both n := 1, from 1.3

    1.5.  1 is odd
          arithmetic, contradicting 1.4
